# Build context is the repository root. Keep it small and keep secrets out of every image.

# Installed or generated inside the image, never copied from the host (host binaries differ).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets: config.ts loads <root>/.env when it exists, so it must never reach an image.
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Not needed to build or run the app.
.git
.claude
.specify
specs
docs
graphify-out
AI_LOG.md
README.md
**/.DS_Store
